## Tracking

As soon as your order ships we email you a tracking number. You can also follow your order from the link in your confirmation email.

## Customs and import duties

Orders shipped outside the country they're made in may be charged import duties or taxes by your country's customs. These are paid by the buyer.

## Wrong address

Please check your address at checkout. If you spot a mistake, email <%= contact %> right away; we can fix it until your order goes into production.
